    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udce2UPDATES &amp; ANNOUNCEMENTS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna know about our development progress or future updates? Join our community and chat with us!\u00a0\u2b50<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740780/extras/00ae24ffe87e63445fa6ee8c7ac8ee67.avif?t=1749576079\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer updates delivered straight to your inbox? Sign up for our monthly newsletter and stay in the loop! \ud83d\udc8c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740780/extras/b396e1b5cae9e2b0452f52631a109eb3.avif?t=1749576079\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfly Scouts is an online multiplayer cozy game where you and your friends play as cute animals at summer camp in an endless starry night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fireflies, stargaze, build campfires, roast marshmallows, chat, earn badges, and decorate your campsite in a peaceful world made for relaxing together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There\u2019s no combat, time limits, or pressure\u2014just a peaceful social space to relax and explore with others online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer social gameplay with up to 10 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firefly catching and stargazing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters and campsites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badge collection and light quest progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill, real-time chat in a persistent world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for low-pressure, relaxing sessions  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfly Scouts is an online multiplayer cozy game where you and your friends play as cute animals at summer camp in an endless starry night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fireflies, stargaze, build campfires, roast marshmallows, chat, earn badges, and decorate your campsite in a peaceful world made for relaxing together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There\u2019s no combat, time limits, or pressure\u2014just a peaceful social space to relax and explore with others online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer social gameplay with up to 10 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firefly catching and stargazing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters and campsites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badge collection and light quest progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill, real-time chat in a persistent world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for low-pressure, relaxing sessions  </p></li></ul>",
